          "ImageDescription": {
            "source": "commons-desc-page",
            "value": "<p><a rel=\"mw:WikiLink/Interwiki\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Antonio%20de%20Cabez%C3%B3n\" title=\"en:Antonio de Cabezón\" class=\"extiw\">Antonio de Cabezón</a>: <i>Canto del Caballero</i>. The first 16 bars. For the complete piece see <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cabezon_Caballero_Complete_Meantone.ogg\" title=\"File:Cabezon Caballero Complete Meantone.ogg\">Image:Cabezon Caballero Complete Meantone.ogg</a>.\nThis recording uses 1/4th comma <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink/Interwiki\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Meantone%20temperament\" title=\"en:Meantone temperament\" class=\"extiw\">meantone temperament</a>. For a version using <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink/Interwiki\" href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Equal%20temperament\" title=\"en:Equal temperament\" class=\"extiw\">equal temperament</a> see <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Cabezon_Caballero_Beginning_Equal.ogg\" title=\"File:Cabezon Caballero Beginning Equal.ogg\">Image:Cabezon Caballero Beginning Equal.ogg</a>.</p>\nHarpsichord recording by <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/User:Rs_newhouse\" title=\"User:Rs newhouse\">Robert Schröter</a>."
